<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0577_T24R0501_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? You need medicine?\rYour homies look fine. What’s\nbotherin’ you?\r...\rThe Lighthouse homie sick?!\rI GOT you! 500 years in business,\nbaby!\fThis’ll fix it right up. Don’t read\nthe label.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0577_T24R0501_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">garbage</attribute>
		<language name="English"></language>
		<language name="日本語">XXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXXX</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0577_T24R0501_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My SecretPotion is a lil TOO strong.\fEmergencies only. Side effects\ninclude\feverythin’.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0577_T24R0501_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What’s good? 500 years in business.\nSame recipe. Same guy. Don’t ask.\rNeed some medicine? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
